      "text": "[7:32p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good in and out of VI at the moment.\n\n- Ahmadu Bello Way is good;\n- IMB inward the Coastal Road is good;\n- IMB inward Akin Adesola is good;\n- Adetokunboh Ademola is good;\n- Adeola Odeku is good;\n- Ozumba Mbadiwe is good;\n- Ajose Adeogun is good;\n \nOur men are strategically located.\n\n@jidesanwoolu @drobafemihamzat @followlasg @lagosMOT1 @seunosiyemi_ @Sola_Giwa @walemusa @Mr_JAGs @lagostraffic961",
