      "text": "[8:40p.m.] #Ketu #IkoroduRoad #TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic is good coming in from Maryland through the Odo-Iyalaro Bridge, New Garage, Ojota bus stop, Ojota Interchange, Tipper Garage, Ketu, Iyana School, and approaching Mile 12.\n\n Our men are strategically located, ensuring good traffic flow.\n\n@jidesanwoolu @drobafemihamzat @seunosiyemi_ @Sola_Giwa @walemusa @followlasg @lagostraffic961 @Mr_JAGs",
